WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.400
Maître d' presents: The place setting in 30 seconds.

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.800
(A formal place setting draws itself, seen from above.)

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.400
B, bread plate. Upper left. Break off one bite at a time.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:14.900
W, water glass. Upper right, just above the knife.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.400
Forks on the left. Use them from the outside in, one per course.

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:21.900
Knife and spoon on the right. The blade always faces the plate.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:25.400
Dessert above the plate. Used last. Wait for the course.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Now you know. Bon appétit. Maître d', business dining etiquette.
